      <Id>{d7292350-a6c3-11e8-98d0-529269fb1459}</Id>
    </SelectedLibraryCategories>
    <Description>4.0.0.0 - TwinCAT 4026 release with unit tests and a TcPkg package.
  - TestRunner PLC project added to the solution: 31 TcUnit suites, 165 tests, run on the usermode runtime.
  - Published as a .library and as a TcPkg package (Intecre.Utilities) with the Beckhoff library packages as dependencies.
  - Fixed: FB_Dictionary.Remove had its guard inverted (returned FALSE for keys that exist, removed nothing for keys that do not).
  - Fixed: F_DictionaryValuesCrc read index 0 on every pass, so only the first value went into the CRC.
  - Fixed: TryStringToWord accepted values above 65535 (the range check ran on the already-truncated WORD).
  - Fixed: F_ConcatLarge measured its inputs with LEN, which stops at 255 characters; it now uses LEN2 so inputs over 255 characters are kept.
  - Changed: TryStringToDint/Udint/Lreal/Word always set the output to 0 when they fail, including for an empty string.
  - Changed: CharIsNumberOrMinus parameter renamed from Char (a reserved word in 4026) to bChar, matching its siblings. Positional callers are unaffected.
  - Dependencies: Tc2_Math, Tc2_Standard, Tc2_System, Tc2_Utilities, Tc3_Module (stable TcPkg feed) and Tc2_MDP (testing feed only).

3.4.3.0 - corrects Task.TimeString bug

3.4.2.0 - recovered from another lib.
3.4.1.0 - adds attribute to_string to E_LogSeverity
3.4.0.0 - adds Constants GVL with NULL 
3.2.2.2 - Write points added
3.2.2.1 - Adding Write Control Structures
3.2.2.0 Adding OPC UA structures.
3.2.1.2 - correcting bug in T_ReleaseHandle
3.2.1.1 - Removing I_LOgger, updating to intercre utils T_NamedBase, and some other small changes.
3.2.0.0 - adding ADS libs - thanks to Beckhoff USA (check out their GitHub examples)
3.1.5.2 - adding AlphaBeta filter
3.1.5.1 modifying string list to add on-stop get and remove.
3.1.5.0 Adding KL33xx to Terminal Interfaces
3.1.4.0 Adding TryStringToDint
3.1.3.0 Adding ObjectName to T_NamedBase</Description>
    <ProjectVersion>4.0.0.0</ProjectVersion>
